The scouts are learning survival skills. First, map skills and compass reading help you find the way. If you are lost, build a shelter from branches. Look for fresh water and boil it. Practise a strong rope knot. To ask for help, give a signal: three whistle signals mean danger. Always carry an extra torch battery!

